; mso-hansi-font-family: 나눔고딕\">」</span>을 추진하고 있으며<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">,&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><u><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">창업지원비</span></u><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">, </span></u><u><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,255); mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">해외 스타트업 컨퍼런스 참가</span></u></font><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\"> </span></u><font face=\"굴림\"><u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\"><font face=\"굴림\">등 다양한 지원혜택을 제공</font></span></u>하고자 합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">이에<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">, </span>관심있는 대학<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">(</span>원<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">)</span>생들이 많은 참여&nbsp;바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">.</span></font></p><p style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 나눔고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">1. </font></span>모집개요</font></p><p style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">1) </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">사 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: -1.6pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">업 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">: 2018</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">년 열혈청년 창업역량 강화사업</span></font></p><p style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: -0.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">2) </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">모집기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕\">:</span></font><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"> </span></u><font face=\"굴림\"><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: rgb(0,117,200); LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\"><u>2018. 05. 03(목) ~ 2018. 05. 25(</u></span></u><u><span styl